--- !u!114 &134363263
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 134363262}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - "You lookin\u2019 for something kid?"
  - '& 1: Actually, yes. Any unowned items hanging around? 2: Any gossip around the
    village?'
  - "Well, there is that old charm with the tassel. It\u2019s been lying in the commune
    for years. Used to belong to some child."
  - '1: Where is the commune again? 2: Some child? ^'
  - "Plenty. Buy I\u2019ll tell ya, that craftsman is so high and mighty. He thinks
    he can go it alone. Doesn\u2019t he know we\u2019re a community?"
  - "^ 1: He seems content up there. 2: Why doesn\u2019t he?"
  branch1:
  - "It\u2019s the big building next to the graveyard. You cant miss it."
  branch2:
  - "Yes, he was the farmer\u2019s son. No! he was the shaman\u2019s son. Me and
    my memory haha!"
  branch3:
  - "Too content! We\u2019re all suffering and he does nothing to help out!"
  branch4:
  - "Its just the way he is. He\u2019s always been the loner type."
  skipNum: 3
