--- !u!114 &451179549
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 451179548}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Hey! How are you? I have a gift for you!
  - "& 1: A gift? 2: Your father\u2026 he seems distant."
  - "Yeah! It\u2019s a cormorant feather! Mr. Fisherman used to fish with one, apparantley.
    He gave it to another kid a long time ago. You can have it now!"
  - "1: The kid he gave it to, was it the shaman\u2019s son? 2: Where is it? ^"
  - "Yeah\u2026 ever since my siblings and mother passed away, he hasn\u2019t been
    the same."
  - "^ 1: How did they pass? 2: The shaman\u2019s son died too, right?"
  branch1:
  - "Y-yeah, how\u2019d you know? You\u2019re a smart guy!"
  branch2:
  - "It\u2019s in my house. Go ahead and grab it, you\u2019re always welcome!"
  branch3:
  - The famine hit really hard a few years ago. A lot of people died...
  branch4:
  - "Yeah, I don\u2019t remember him, but a lot of people died back then apparently."
  skipNum: 3
