--- !u!114 &485536227
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 485536226}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Hello again child. You seem troubled...
  - '& 1: Did you know the Wyrm was being controlled? 2: I must tell you... I am
    part of the Wyrm.'
  - "Yes, I\u2019m afraid I did. I am sorry to have mislead you. I have spent the
    past 2 years trying to figure out how to free the Wyrm."
  - '1: What has possessed the Wyrm, exactly? 2: Did you learn how? ^'
  - Hmm... I figured as much. A child no one knows appearing in the village one day
    was quite conspicuous. In my study of the divine, I should have guessed you were
    a part of it.
  - "^ 1: What do I do now, knowing what I know? 2: You aren\u2019t suprised?"
  branch1:
  - Long ago, I killed a man- my brother, for trying to destroy humanity. His undead
    vengeance transformed him into ths spirit that controls Thuong Luong.
  branch2:
  - Somewhat. The Wyrm needs to be empowered to free itself from the grasp of this
    spirit. You must find out how.
  branch3:
  - If you are truly part of Thuong Luong, you must reclaim the relics you left when
    you were mortal. You must return to Thuong Luong to empower it.
  branch4:
  - "I have spent much time studying the gods and their ways. Something wasn\u2019t
    right with the way the Wyrm was acting. You were the missing piece."
  skipNum: 3
