--- !u!114 &508091536
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 508091535}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Hello again, young fellow. How do you do?
  - "& 1: What do you know about the \u2018sacrifices\u2019 a few years back? 2:
    You seem pretty secluded up here."
  - "Oh that dreadful time. Yes, the astrologer went mad back then. There\u2019s
    no proof, but everyone seems to believe he was the one behind the disappearance
    of those children. "
  - '1: What was the astrologer like? 2: What happened to him? ^'
  - "Well, those three down by the farm aren\u2019t my cup of tea. I prefer my solitude
    anyhow. It\u2019s peaceful."
  - '^ 1: Do you ever help out in the village? 2: Are you worried about the weather?'
  branch1:
  - Before taking a trip away from the village, he was a kind and considerate man.
    Afterwards, he became a cold and miserable shut-in.
  branch2:
  - He was killed by his brother. You know him as the teacher. A shame, he used to
    be a good man.
  branch3:
  - "I contribute by performing my craft. I don\u2019t believe any more should be
    expected of me."
  branch4:
  - "Yes, it\u2019s quite troubling. I hope it will all be over soon..."
  skipNum: 3
