--- !u!114 &1063032328
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1063032327}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - You got a quizzical look on your face there, kiddo!
  - "& 1: Do you remember the shaman\u2019s other kid? The one who died? 2: Have
    you seen any Wyrms around?"
  - Ah, yes, I remember him well. Why do ya ask?
  - '1: Being the merchant, do you have anything that might have belonged to him?
    2: Do you know how he died? ^'
  - "Yeah, I\u2019ve seen \u2018em! They\u2019re elusive, but I saw one thrashing
    its way through the woods the other day. Keep on the lookout. "
  - '^ 1: Has anyone been killed by one of them? 2: Where are they coming from?'
  branch1:
  - "Actually, I think I do! Can\u2019t remember where it is, but somewhere in my
    house is a scroll he used to read quite often."
  branch2:
  - No one really knows, but his father was a shady character. I think he was the
    one behind the sacrifices, so my money is on it being him.
  branch3:
  - No, but the craftsman got scratched by one entering his house once. He barely
    escaped with his life!
  branch4:
  - "Beats me. In any case, they\u2019re bad news. Good luck out there, kid!"
  skipNum: 3
