--- !u!114 &1138442697
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1138442696}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - "Hey there! Glad you made friends with my son, not so many kids around these
    days\u2026"
  - "& 1. Why so few children? 2. What about the shaman\u2019s other son?"
  - "Well, uh\u2026 after the sacrifices and-\u201D  \u201CI apologize, sonny, not
    a tale for children, I\u2019m afraid."
  - '1: Oh... sorry for asking... 2: Sacrifices? ^'
  - Oh- yes, I remember him. In fact, I still have that feather he kept in his hair
    haha!
  - '^ 1: Where is it? 2: Feather?'
  branch1:
  - Its okay, sonny. Run along now, will you? Maybe play with my son?
  branch2:
  - Yes... it happened years ago. The teachers brother, the astrologer, committed
    horrible acts such as those. And I thought we were civilized...
  branch3:
  - "It\u2019s in my house. If you want it, go ahead and grab it. I don\u2019t need
    it. It just brings back memories of that time..."
  branch4:
  - "A cormorant feather. The fisherman used to use one to catch fish. It died after
    he couldn\u2019t feed it anymore."
  skipNum: 3
