--- !u!114 &1149545034
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1149545033}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - Brother, I am... glad to see you. I have to apologize.
  - '& 1: For what? 2: You were transformed into a Wyrm. How do you feel?'
  - "For trying to kill you while I was in Wyrm form. I didn\u2019t have control
    over myself, but I\u2019m sorry all the same."
  - "1: It\u2019s okay, you didn\u2019t know what was happening. 2: Mom can\u2019t
    get away with doing that to you. ^"
  - It was so strange. All the time that I was transformed, I felt this... compulsion.
  - '^ 1:Are you hurt? 2: A compulsion?'
  branch1:
  - "I\u2019m... I\u2019m also sorry about being jealous of you. Mom always saw you
    as the favorite. That wasn\u2019t right, but it wasn\u2019t your fault."
  branch2:
  - "Yeah, we can\u2019t. She will stop at nothing to keep you from returning to
    the Wyrm."
  branch3:
  - "No, I\u2019m all right. But you... you have to go back to the Wyrm again, don\u2019t
    you? That\u2019s what mom was trying to prevent."
  branch4:
  - Yes, a compulsion to become whole with the Wyrm. Is that what you feel all the
    time? It must be awful.
  skipNum: 3
