  - "They exclude me from everything anyway! Why would I want to be friends with
    those jerks? Besides, Dad doesn\u2019t want me being around them\u2026 &"
  - "Shut up! He\u2019s preparing me for a cutthroat world, y\u2019know. I don\u2019t
    need nice parents like the others\u2026"
