--- !u!114 &1165991426
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1165991425}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - You! My son! How could you free your brother? You could have stayed with me,
    we could have been together again!
  - '& 1: My brothers life matters too! 2: I know what I am now! I have to return
    to the wyrm.'
  - I would gladly banish his soul away in place of yours.
  - '1: Why?! 2: You are purely selfish. ^'
  - You have no idea what you truly are. Part of the Wyrm, yes, but also kin of the
    spirit that controls it!
  - "^ 1: What are you talking about?! 2: I don\u2019t care! I need to stop the Wyrm\u2019s
    rampage no matter what I am!"
  branch1:
  - I could have tricked the spirit Ma Quy into thinking his soul was yours! It would
    have worked!
  branch2:
  - I may be, but all I want is want you back, my son.
  branch3:
  - "Ma Quy was my husband, and your father. When he was killed he became what he
    is now. Knowing that, don\u2019t you want to stay here with me?"
  branch4:
  - "You are rebellious now, but you\u2019ll see. You\u2019ll understand. And if
    you don\u2019t I\u2019ll make you!"
  skipNum: 3
