--- !u!114 &1518555164
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1518555163}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - "You\u2026 Why are you looking at me weird?"
  - '& 1: Your son is really mean to the other kids. 2: How are you faring in the
    crisis facing the village?'
  - Perhaps those other children should show my son respect! He will talk to you
    all any way he wants.
  - '1: Is that really the way to raise your child? 2: Okay... ^'
  - "Ah- um... brilliantly, of course! I\u2019ve never been better!"
  - "^ 1: Really? You don\u2019t sound sure. 2: All that land being freed up by the
    storms won\u2019t be any good if theres no one left to buy it."
  branch1:
  - You are but a child yourself! What could you know of raising one?
  branch2:
  - "This world is cruel, boy. I\u2019m preparing my son for the worst."
  branch3:
  - "What are you talking about? I\u2019m living the life! The storms will pass,
    surely..."
  branch4:
  - "The storms are but a fleeting thing. The village will get through it one day,
    and when it does, I\u2019ll be even richer!"
  skipNum: 3
