--- !u!114 &1546858986
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1546858985}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - "You again\u2026 I thought I told ye\u2019 to steer clear from the river."
  - "& 1: Sorry, I forgot about that. 2: Do you remember the shaman\u2019s child
    at all?"
  - Well, try to remember, yeah? Dangerous times...
  - '1: Any luck fishing today? 2: Are you afraid of the river flooding? ^'
  - "The one that passed away? Aye, I remember \u2018em. Very sad. Ye look like him,
    y\u2019know."
  - '^ 1: Did you ever see him with any special object? Like a toy? 2: How did he
    die?'
  branch1:
  - "Nay, no luck today. No luck ever, really. I\u2019m lucky if I can get a single
    fish..."
  branch2:
  - "Aye, I am. It floods all th\u2019 time these days, but a big flood could do
    real harm, ya know?"
  branch3:
  - "Hrm... not sure \u2018bout a toy, but he always brought that red-tasseled charm
    to town meetings."
  branch4:
  - "He mysteriously vanished overnight. No one knows what happened to \u2018em,
    but if you ask me, that conniving father of his killed him."
  skipNum: 3
