  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1700999941}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a5bf03f7928083b42bd7626d10bdfb25, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - H-hey, you again! Glad you stopped by.
  - '& 1: How are you, mister? 2: What do you think of the other villagers?'
  - "I\u2019m okay, kid. Guess what? The farmer\u2019s jade pendant went missing?"
  - '1: I took it and put it at a shrine. 2: Maybe his luck will get better now.
    ^'
  - "So many of them call me crazy for talking about cursed items but\u2026 In this
    neck of the village, I have friends"
  - '^ 1: What do you think of the shaman? 2: What do you think of the teacher?'
  branch1:
  - You did that? Good job returning it to a place where it belongs.
  branch2:
  - 
  branch3:
  - "She\u2019s on odd one. I don\u2019t pay her much mind, but she can\u2019t be
    much better than her husband was..."
  branch4:
  - "Now he\u2019s a smart guy! He\u2019s the only one with his head on straight
    these days."
  skipNum: 3
